    ["<P_Heart>（终会有所磨损的木质或金属守卫们。也许世界的某个角落，会有一面耐久度惊人的勇士之盾……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Деревянные или металлические ограждения, которые со временем изнашиваются. Возможно, в каком-то уголке мира появится щит воина с удивительной прочностью...)</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>The detective's assistant</> suddenly rushed out of the crowd, blocking the girl's path."] = "<P_Yellow>Помощник детектива </> внезапно выскочил из толпы, преградив девушке путь.",
    ["<P_Yellow>封印物·知识皇冠</>\n\n<P_Yellow>等级</>\n0级\n<P_Yellow>途径</>\n窥秘人\n<P_Yellow>来源</>\n罗塞尔大帝在白枫宫被刺杀后，体内未排除的知识皇帝特性与其皇冠结合形成的遗物，蕴含▇▇母神的污染。 \n\n<P_Yellow>正面效果</>\n知识具象化，可将实物瓦解为知识洪流。\n通晓大部分知识，并直接解读隐秘信息（包括神灵的隐秘）。\n理解超越序列的宇宙真理与神秘本质。\n能对低位格者下达精神控制与认知重塑的指令。 \n\n<P_Yellow>负面效果</>\n皇冠会持续灌输无法承受的海量真理与禁忌知识，解读知识会随机失去一部分理智或人格。\n摘下皇冠会触发知识洪流反噬，导致持有者灵魂被瞬间冲散，成为无知无识的空壳。\n\n<P_Yellow>封印物·绝望魔镜</>\n\n<P_Yellow>等级</>\n不明，未定级\n<P_Yellow>途径</>\n刺客\n<P_Yellow>来源</>\n绝望魔女赫尔嘉晋升序列3时失败而失控，为避免其彻底化为怪物，子爵夫人亲手终结其生命，其遗留的非凡特性与一枚镜子结合并异化。赫尔嘉生前与子爵夫人相识，二人情谊深厚。其死后残存意志与特性结合，形成此封印物。\n\n<P_Yellow>正面效果</>\n可构建独立的镜中空间。\n具备意识封印能力，可将强大的精神体或神性意志分割封印。\n\n<P_Yellow>负面效果</>\n具有强烈的自毁意识与厌世倾向，会诱导周边生物摧毁魔镜，镜面破碎会爆发强烈的灵性反噬。\n无差别地吸收周围生命的希望与情感，将其转化为维持镜中世界的养分，范围内的生物会逐渐感到空虚、麻木，最终主动走向自我毁灭。"] = "<P_Yellow>Запечатанный артефакт · Knowledge Crown</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nLevel 0\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nПодглядывающий за Тайнами\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nA relic formed after Emperor Roselle was assassinated at White Maple Palace, combining the unexpelled Knowledge Emperor characteristic within his body with his crown. It contains the Искажение of the ▇▇ Mother Goddess. \n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nMaterializes knowledge, capable of disintegrating physical objects into a Torrent of Knowledge.\nGrants knowledge of most subjects and allows for the direct interpretation of hidden information (including the secrets of deities).\nProvides understanding of cosmic truths and mystical essences that transcend Последовательностьs.\nCan issue commands for Mind Control and cognitive restructuring to those of a lower Последовательность. \n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nThe crown continuously instills an unbearable amount of truth and Forbidden Knowledge; interpreting this knowledge results in a random loss of Рассудок or personality.\nRemoving the crown triggers a backlash of the Torrent of Knowledge, instantly shattering the holder's soul and leaving them an ignorant, empty shell.\n\n<P_Yellow>Запечатанный артефакт · Magic Mirror of Despair</>\n\n<P_Yellow>Level</>\nUnknown, Unrated\n<P_Yellow>Pathway</>\nAssassin\n<P_Yellow>Origin</>\nFormed when the Despair Witch Helga failed her advancement to Последовательность 3 and lost control. To prevent her from fully transforming into a monster, the Viscountess ended her life personally. The remaining Потусторонний characteristic combined with a mirror and mutated. Helga and the Viscountess were close friends during Helga's lifetime. Her residual will combined with the characteristic to form this Запечатанный артефакт.\n\n<P_Yellow>Positive Effects</>\nCapable of constructing an independent mirror world.\nPossesses consciousness-sealing abilities, capable of segmenting and sealing powerful spirits or divine wills.\n\n<P_Yellow>Negative Effects</>\nPossesses a strong self-destructive consciousness and misanthropic tendencies; it will induce nearby creatures to destroy the magic mirror. If the mirror surface shatters, it triggers a violent spiritual backlash.\nIndiscriminately absorbs the hope and emotions of surrounding life forms, converting them into nutrients to sustain the mirror world. Creatures within range will gradually feel empty and numb, eventually walking toward self-destruction.",
